        "description": "每固定发布版本×批次结束日×来源身份；一致性维度分析切片，跨日总计按岗位去重。",
        "lineageTag": "8dcff4c7-ac09-424f-a91b-1bc32b154faf",
        "measures": [
          {
            "name": "快照核心岗位数",
            "description": "按当前筛选重算去重岗位集合；城市多值不可累加，技能选择保持正文分母。",
            "expression": "VAR K = VALUES(SnapshotCityJobs[snapshot_key]) RETURN COALESCE(CALCULATE(DISTINCTCOUNT(SnapshotJobs[job_key]),KEEPFILTERS(SnapshotJobs[is_core]=TRUE()), TREATAS(K,SnapshotJobs[snapshot_key])),0)",
            "formatString": "#,0",
            "lineageTag": "0f352edf-d468-4496-b25f-a21ca30bf08a"
          },
          {
            "name": "快照正文分母",
            "description": "按当前筛选重算去重岗位集合；城市多值不可累加，技能选择保持正文分母。",
            "expression": "VAR K = VALUES(SnapshotCityJobs[snapshot_key]) RETURN COALESCE(CALCULATE(DISTINCTCOUNT(SnapshotJobs[job_key]),KEEPFILTERS(SnapshotJobs[is_core]=TRUE()), TREATAS(K,SnapshotJobs[snapshot_key]), KEEPFILTERS(SnapshotJobs[body_valid]=TRUE())),0)",
            "formatString": "#,0",
            "lineageTag": "cbb5b8c9-02b5-4e77-a383-536a3af846f5"
          },
          {
            "name": "快照技能岗位数",
            "description": "按当前筛选重算去重岗位集合；城市多值不可累加，技能选择保持正文分母。",
            "expression": "VAR K = VALUES(SnapshotCityJobs[snapshot_key]) RETURN COALESCE(CALCULATE(DISTINCTCOUNT(SnapshotSkillJobs[job_key]),KEEPFILTERS(SnapshotJobs[is_core]=TRUE()), TREATAS(K,SnapshotJobs[snapshot_key]), KEEPFILTERS(SnapshotJobs[body_valid]=TRUE())),0)",
            "formatString": "#,0",
            "lineageTag": "6741e897-60ff-4080-8d9d-cbaf4d40717a"
          },
          {
            "name": "快照技能占比",
            "description": "按当前筛选重算去重岗位集合；城市多值不可累加，技能选择保持正文分母。",
            "expression": "DIVIDE([快照技能岗位数],[快照正文分母])",
            "formatString": "0.0%",
            "lineageTag": "1880a65a-c17c-438f-8cf9-82166fb4a2ea"
          },
          {
            "name": "可比新增观察数",
            "description": "按当前筛选重算去重岗位集合；城市多值不可累加，技能选择保持正文分母。",
            "expression": "IF(HASONEVALUE(Calendar[date_key]),MAX(SnapshotDays[newly_observed_count]))",
            "formatString": "#,0",
            "lineageTag": "363324cc-4118-4bf2-b9eb-a0d4980d25d3"
          }
        ],
        "partitions": [
          {
            "name": "SnapshotJobs",
            "mode": "import",
            "source": {
              "expression": "Odbc.Query(\"driver={ODBC Driver 18 for SQL Server};server=lpc:localhost;database=recruitment_dw_dev_cd_v1;encrypt=yes;trustservercertificate=yes;\", \"SELECT CONCAT(release_id,'|',date_key,'|',job_key) AS snapshot_key,* FROM ads.release_job_detail WHERE release_id=5\")",
